# Updating ticket <ticketAlias> status to <status> and priority to <priority> for user <userAlias>
* clicking on stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> card
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-detail-status-selector']"
* clicking on text <status> in "ul[role='listbox']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-detail-priority-selector']"
* clicking on text <priority> in "ul[role='listbox']"

# Verifying ticket <ticketAlias> was created
* clicking on "[data-testid='channel-tab-tickets']"
* waiting for "[data-testid^='ticket-card-']" to appear

# Creating ticket <ticketAlias> from chat for user <userAlias>
* ensuring ticket <ticketAlias> exists in fixture for user <userAlias>
* Navigating to channel "channel-1" for user <userAlias>
* waiting for "[data-testid='message-input']" to appear
* typing "Bug report from chat for ticket creation flow" in "[data-testid='message-input']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='send-options-menu']"
* clicking on text "Create a ticket"
* clicking on "[data-testid='send-message-button']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='ticket-title-input']" to appear
* typing stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "title" in "[data-testid='ticket-title-input']"
* typing stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "description" in "[data-testid='ticket-description-input']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-priority-selector']"
* clicking on text "Medium" in "[data-testid='ticket-priority-selector-options']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-submit-button']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='ticket-title-input']" to disappear

# Creating ticket <ticketAlias> from message hover for user <userAlias> with message <messageText> and priority <priority>
* ensuring ticket <ticketAlias> exists in fixture for user <userAlias>
* waiting for "[data-testid='message-input']" to appear
* typing <messageText> in "[data-testid='message-input']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='send-message-button']"
* waiting for message with text <messageText> to appear in virtuoso list
* clicking hover action "[data-testid='hover-action-create-ticket']" on message with text <messageText>
* waiting for "[data-testid='ticket-title-input']" to appear
* typing stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "title" in "[data-testid='ticket-title-input']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-assignee-selector']"
* typing stored user "user-2" field "name" in "[data-testid='ticket-assignee-selector-input']"
* clicking on stored user "user-2" field "name" in "[data-testid='ticket-assignee-selector-options']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-priority-selector']"
* clicking on text <priority> in "[data-testid='ticket-priority-selector-options']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-status-selector']"
* clicking on text "Todo" in "[data-testid='ticket-status-selector-options']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='ticket-submit-button']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='ticket-title-input']" to disappear

